## Field/Column Operations

### Available Operations
- `list_fields`: List all columns `{table_id}` - returns field names, types, IDs
- `create_field`: Add column `{table_id, field_name, field_type, field_required?, related_table_id?, field_config?}`
- `delete_field`: Remove column `{table_id, field_name}` - WARNING: deletes all data in column!

### Field Types Reference

| Type | Config Required | Description |
|------|-----------------|-------------|
| `text` | None | Basic text |
| `number` | None | Numeric values |
| `boolean` | None | true/false |
| `date` | None | ISO 8601 dates |
| `email` | None | Validated emails |
| `phone` | Optional | Phone numbers |
| `json` | None | Arbitrary JSON |
| `relation` | **related_table_id** | Link to another table |
| `file` | Optional | File attachments |
| `single-select` | **field_config.options** | Dropdown selection |
| `multi-select` | **field_config.options** | Multi-value selection |
| `embedding` | **field_config.embeddingSize** | Vector embeddings |
| `autonumber` | Optional | Auto-increment |
| `created-at` | None | Auto timestamp |
| `last-updated` | None | Auto timestamp |

### Examples

```python
# List all columns
field_crud(method="list_fields", table_id="42")

# Add a simple text column
field_crud(method="create_field", table_id="42", field_name="notes", field_type="text")

# Add a required email column
field_crud(method="create_field", table_id="42", field_name="contact_email",
           field_type="email", field_required=True)

# Add a dropdown/select column
field_crud(method="create_field", table_id="42", field_name="status",
           field_type="single-select",
           field_config={"options": [
               {"value": "Pending", "color": "yellow"},
               {"value": "Active", "color": "green"},
               {"value": "Closed", "color": "gray"}
           ]})

# Add a relation to another table
field_crud(method="create_field", table_id="42", field_name="assigned_to",
           field_type="relation", related_table_id="15")

# Add an embedding column
field_crud(method="create_field", table_id="42", field_name="content_embedding",
           field_type="embedding", field_config={"embeddingSize": 1536})

# Delete a column (WARNING: deletes all data!)
field_crud(method="delete_field", table_id="42", field_name="old_column")
```

### Important Notes

- Field name `id` is reserved for the system row identifier
- Auto-fields (autonumber, created-at, last-updated) are read-only
- Select options require `value` and `color` properties
- Embedding sizes: 384, 768, 1536, or 3072
- Deleting a field permanently removes all data in that column
